# KAKU System Documentation

## NVS (Non-Volatile Storage)

| NVS Key | Type | Default | Description |
|---------|------|---------|-------------|
| `hunger` | int | 0 | 0-100 (100 = starving) |
| [health](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/app.py#1760-1768) | int | 100 | 0-100 |
| `energy` | int | 100 | 0-100 |
| `happiness` | int | 100 | 0-100 |
| `discipline` | int | 100 | 0-100 |
| [xp](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/app.py#1704-1744) | int | 0 | Cumulative experience |
| `level` | int | 1 | Pet level |
| `ageInt` | int | 0 | Age in days |
| `uptime` | uint32 | 0 | Total active seconds |
| `isSick` | bool | false | Sickness state |
| `hasPoop` | bool | false | Poop present |
| `version` | int | 0 | State version (conflict resolution) |

WiFi credentials also stored in NVS namespace `"wifi"`.

---

## Boot / Reset Behavior

> [!CAUTION]
> **Currently, every boot resets all pet state to INFANT defaults** (hunger=0, health=100, etc.) and plays the full egg-hatching animation. This means losing all progress on every power cycle.

**Boot sequence:**
1. Serial init → I2C/OLED init → WiFi provisioning (NVS creds → hardcoded → AP mode)
2. Show "KAKU Starting..." text
3. Play egg cracking animation → slide egg out → slide infant in
4. **Reset ALL pet state to defaults** ([savePetState()](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/esp32_sketch/esp32_sketch.ino#348-366) with fresh values)
5. Init MPU6050, camera, audio → drop CPU to 80MHz
6. Start FreeRTOS tasks: [oledTask](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/esp32_sketch/esp32_sketch.ino#829-832) (Core 0), [networkTask](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/esp32_sketch/esp32_sketch.ino#831-834) (Core 1)

---

## Data Flow: Hardware ↔ Server

### When data IS sent (all via [networkTask](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/esp32_sketch/esp32_sketch.ino#831-834) on Core 1):

| Request | Trigger | Interval | Data Sent |
|---------|---------|----------|-----------|
| `NET_SENSOR` | Staggered scheduler | Every **10s** | Accel/gyro batch, mic level, chip temp, sleep seconds, step count, **full pet_state** (hunger, health, happiness, discipline, energy, level, xp, is_sick, has_poop, age, uptime) |
| `NET_OLED` | Staggered scheduler | Every **2s** | GET request to `/api/oled-display/get` — receives pet state, emotion, icons, events, OTA flag |
| `NET_IMAGE` | Feeding gesture (left tilt 3s on FOOD_MENU) | On demand | Base64 camera image |
| `NET_CLEAN` | Cleaning gesture (left tilt 3s on TOILET_MENU) | On demand | Cleaning request to `/api/pet/clean` |
| `NET_INJECT` | Medicine gesture (left tilt 3s on HEALTH_MENU) | On demand | Injection request to `/api/pet/inject` |
| `NET_HAPPY` | Right tilt menu cycle | On each cycle | Happiness +5 request |

### When data is NOT sent:
- **During sleep** — all network activity is paused
- **During image upload** — sensor/OLED polling paused to avoid SSL conflicts
- **WiFi disconnected** — retries with stored/hardcoded credentials

---

## OTA Updates

OTA does **NOT** run on a periodic timer. It works as follows:
1. Server sets `ota_update: true` in the OLED poll response (`/api/oled-display/get`)
2. Hardware reads this flag during `NET_OLED` processing
3. If `otaUpdateRequested == true`, calls [checkAndPerformOTA()](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/esp32_sketch/esp32_sketch.ino#4271-4553) immediately
4. OTA checks `/api/firmware/latest?device_id=ESP32_001&current_version=X.X.X`
5. If newer version exists, downloads and flashes

**Trigger:** Manual toggle from the frontend dashboard (Enable OTA button).

---

## Home Screen Icons

### Top-Left Corner (mutually exclusive):

| Icon | Variable | When Shown | Cause |
|------|----------|------------|-------|
| 🏠 Home | `showHomeIcon` | On MAIN screen when no play icon | Default, set when `currentScreenType == "MAIN"` |
| 🎮 Play | `showPlayIcon` | **Overrides Home** when active | Currently: set by server via [show_play_icon](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/app.py#2296-2318) in OLED poll (not yet implemented locally) |

### Bottom-Right Corner (priority: SICK > POOP > HUNGER):

| Icon | Variable | When Shown | Cause & Trigger |
|------|----------|------------|-----------------|
| ❤️ Sick | `showSickIcon` | Pet is sick | Poop neglected >15 min (server-side logic), or 1% random chance per tick if OLD age |
| 💩 Poop | `showPoopIcon` | Poop present | 5% random chance per 60s physiology tick, only when `hunger < 50` and no existing poop |
| 🍽️ Food | `showFoodIcon` | Pet is hungry | `hunger > 70` (set in [syncLocalStateToUI](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/esp32_sketch/esp32_sketch.ino#420-460)) |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Icons are **hidden during walking and sleeping** animations.

---

## State Triggers & Timing

### When does HUNGER occur?
- Every **60s** physiology tick, hunger increases by a stage-dependent amount:
  - INFANT: +15 per tick
  - CHILD: +10 per tick
  - ADULT: +8 per tick
  - OLD: +12 per tick
- **Food icon appears** when `hunger > 70`
- **Emotion changes** to CRY (infant) or HUNGER (others)
- **Cure:** Feed via left tilt 3s on FOOD_MENU (camera captures food)

### When does POOP occur?
- Every 60s tick: **5% random chance** if `hunger < 50` and no existing poop
- This means poop comes **after the pet has been fed** (low hunger)
- **Cure:** Left tilt 3s on TOILET_MENU → cleaning animation

### When does SICK occur?
- **Server-side:** Poop neglected for >15 minutes → `is_sick = true`
- **Hardware:** 1% random chance per tick if pet is OLD age
- **Cure:** Left tilt 3s on HEALTH_MENU → injection animation (3 loops)

### When does PLAY icon appear?
- **Currently:** Set by server via [show_play_icon](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/app.py#2296-2318) in OLED poll response
- **Planned:** Will appear 15 minutes after poop is cleared

---

## Consequences of Neglect

Every 60s physiology tick applies **health penalties**:

| Neglected Condition | Health Loss/tick | Other Effects |
|---------------------|-----------------|---------------|
| `hunger > 80` | -5 | — |
| `energy < 20` | -2 | — |
| `hasPoop == true` | -10 | Discipline -2/tick |
| `isSick == true` | -15 | — |
| `hunger > 90` | — | Discipline -2/tick |

If health reaches 0 → pet is in critical condition but does not die.

---

## Age System

### How age increases:
- `totalUptimeSecs` increments by 60 every physiology tick
- **1 day = 86,400 seconds** of active uptime
- When `totalUptimeSecs / 86400 > ageInt`, age increments + level up + 100 XP

### Age → Stage mapping:

| Age (days) | Stage | Variable |
|-----------|-------|----------|
| 0-5 | INFANT | `petAge = INFANT` |
| 6-10 | CHILD | `petAge = CHILD` |
| 11-17 | ADULT | `petAge = ADULT` |
| 18+ | OLD | `petAge = OLD` |

### Animations by age × emotion:

| Emotion | Animation Arrays |
|---------|-----------------|
| HAPPY | `infant_happy`, `happy_child`, `happy_adult`, `old_happy` |
| CRY | `infant_cry_frames`, `cry_child`, `cry_adult`, `old_cry` |
| SURPRISE | `infant_surprise_frames`, `child_surprise`, `surprise_adult`, `old_surprise` |
| SAD/HUNGER/POOP | `infant_sad_frames`, `child_sad`, `adult_sad`, `old_sad` |
| IDLE | `infant_frames[0]`, `child_frames[0]`, `adult_frames[0]`, `old_happy[0]` (static) |
| Default | `infant_frames`, `child_frames`, `adult_frames`, `old_happy` (animated) |

> [!NOTE]
> Food, hunger, poop, play, sickness **work at every age**. Only animation sprites change.

---

## Sleep System

- **Trigger:** Device held **inverted (face-down) for 30 seconds** continuously
- **Variable:** `isDeviceSleeping`, `NEUTRAL_SLEEP_TIMEOUT = 30000ms`
- **Detection:** [isDeviceInverted()](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/esp32_sketch/esp32_sketch.ino#733-735) checks if Z-axis < -7.0 m/s²
- **Wake:** Any non-inverted movement

### Effects of sleep:
- All **network activity paused** (no sensor send, no OLED poll)
- **OLED shows sleeping animation** (2-frame, `sleeping_frames[]`)
- **Icons hidden** during sleep
- **Sleep seconds accumulated** in `accumulatedSleepSec`, sent with next sensor upload
- **Physiology tick continues** (hunger still rises during sleep)

---

## Menu System

**Cycle order:** `MAIN → FOOD → TOILET → PLAY → HEALTH → STATUS_INFO → STATS → MAIN`
**Gesture:** Right tilt (accelX > 0.8) held for **2 seconds** → cycles to next menu

### Menu contents by state:

| Menu | No Issues | Hungry | Sick | Poop | Play Active |
|------|-----------|--------|------|------|-------------|
| MAIN | Pet animation + Home icon | SAD animation + Food icon | SAD animation + Sick icon | SAD animation + Poop icon | Pet animation + Play icon (blinks) |
| FOOD | Static food icon + "Feed Me" or tilt-to-feed prompt | Same + feeding gesture available | Same | Same | Same |
| TOILET | Static toilet icon + "Clean" or "No Poop" | — | — | "Clean!" + cleaning gesture available | — |
| PLAY | Play icon + game start prompt (left tilt 3s) | Same | Same | Same | Same |
| HEALTH | Heart icon + "All Good" | Same | **"Give Med"** + injection gesture available | Same | Same |
| STATUS_INFO | Smiley + Age + Flash + Calories | Same | Same | Same | Same |
| STATS | Happiness bar + Discipline bar | Same | Same | Same | Same |

---

## Stats Display — Who Updates, When, How

### OLED Stats:
- **Updated by:** ESP32 hardware locally via [syncLocalStateToUI()](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/esp32_sketch/esp32_sketch.ino#420-460) 
- **When:** After every physiology tick (60s), after gestures (feed/clean/inject), and after OLED poll syncs server state
- **How:** `g_petState` struct → legacy UI globals (`petHappiness`, `petDiscipline`, `petAgeInt`, etc.)

### Frontend Dashboard (Hardware/Debug section):
- **Updated by:** Server broadcasts via Socket.IO when sensor data arrives
- **When:** Every **10 seconds** (when `NET_SENSOR` delivers data)
- **How:** ESP32 sends [pet_state](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/app.py#990-1036) JSON → server's [sync_pet_state_to_db()](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/app.py#344-418) → Socket.IO [emit('pet_state_update')](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/app.py#477-486) → frontend's [updateDebugDashboard(data)](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/index.html#1720-1736)

### Key variables:

| Variable | Source | Controls |
|----------|--------|----------|
| `g_petState.*` | Hardware (authoritative) | All physiology calculations |
| `petIsHungry` | `g_petState.hunger > 70` | Food icon + emotion |
| `petIsSick` | `g_petState.isSick` | Sick icon + health menu |
| `showPoopIcon` | `g_petState.hasPoop` | Poop icon + emotion |
| `showFoodIcon` | `petIsHungry` | Food icon drawing |
| `showSickIcon` | Server's `is_sick` via OLED poll | Sick icon drawing |
| `showPlayIcon` | Server's [show_play_icon](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/app.py#2296-2318) via OLED poll | Play icon drawing |
| `currentEmotion` | Computed in [syncLocalStateToUI()](file:///f:/kakuProject-main/esp32_sketch/esp32_sketch.ino#420-460) | Animation selection |
| `petAge` | Computed from `petAgeInt` | Animation sprite set |
| `currentScreenType` | Local menu cycling | Which screen to display |
